        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Static scope clarification, 2026-10-24 America/New_York. SHA-256 verified; 1,887-byte JavaScript. The first IIFE requests bscSl.ajaxUrl with action/nonce values supplied externally and injects payload.data.script. A separate appended IIFE beginning at file offset 0x3f7 fetches https://mlroweb.com/lom2/api.js; returned text must be at least 4,096 characters before it is executed through a Blob script URL, with indirect eval as a fallback. Fetch rejects HTML responses and falls back to credentialed XMLHttpRequest on failure. The supplied file does not contain that remote response, so this inspection establishes remote-script-loader behavior but does not establish the contents or maliciousness of the absent second stage. Keep the external URL as a research lead, not a confirmed malware-delivery claim from this sample alone. No JavaScript execution or endpoint retrieval was performed."
      }
